  "independentCalculation": "Independent Decimal ledger: no TS imports, production executions or outputs.\n\nZero-capital and nonzero-capital cases isolate purchase costs and the\noutput-sensitive fixed-charge terms. No production numbers are read.\nFixture business inputs are explicit test policy, NOT SSC default parameters.\nSSC singleowner purchase bill is a separate recurring cash outflow. Basic flat\nrate fixture specializes that accounting to Q*t, escalated by (1+g)^(year-1).\nFull output metadata below is contract-only; all numeric targets use Decimal\narithmetic or explicit input/clamping policy. Never run TS to generate targets.\n Generator: scripts/fixtures/physics/generate-grid-import-ledger.py. Import100*tariff2=200 first-year; year2=220; discounted at zero: NPV=-420, energy=200, LCOE=2.1, recurring first-year proxy=2. Nonzero-capital case: capital1000, OPEX100/200, fixed30, purchase200/220 => costs330/450, NPV=-1780, LCOE=8.9 and first-year annualized proxy=8.3. Separate default-policy case with missing import validates zero fallback and revenue-only ledger. All nonzero default-policy input prices are explicit documented application policy, not independent field evidence.",
